groovebox-scene 1
# Syn 1 on pad 1 through the panel: MENU + step 3, then OK, down twice and OK in the sound picker.
input 3200 press menu
input 4800 press step-3
input 6400 release step-3
input 8000 release menu
input 9600 press ok
input 11200 release ok
input 12800 press down
input 14400 release down
input 14800 press down
input 15200 release down
input 16000 press ok
input 17600 release ok
# PAGE + step 2: the Synth page.
input 19200 press page
input 20800 press step-2
input 22400 release step-2
input 24000 release page
frame 25600
# PAGE + step 3: the Filter page, set as Look's picture shows it, with fine clicks under SHIFT where
# they bring a bar to the length Look drew. Down four times to Key follow and + held for 64 moves:
# 50%. Down to Velocity amount and + held for 39 moves: 30%.
input 27200 press page
input 28800 press step-3
input 30400 release step-3
input 32000 release page
input 33600 press down
input 35200 release down
input 36800 press down
input 38400 release down
input 40000 press down
input 41600 release down
input 43200 press down
input 44800 release down
input 48000 press plus
input 217600 release plus
input 219200 press down
input 220800 release down
input 222400 press plus
input 332000 release plus
